            <div xml:id="d163">

                <pb facs="0330" n="984" sameAs="frus:frus1875v02/pg984"/>

                <head>No. 462.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Mariscal to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Mexico</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">New
                            York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1875-07-23"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">July</hi> 23, 1875</date>. (Received July
                        26.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary</hi>: I have the honor to inclose to
                    you a copy of a note addressed to me by the minister of foregn relations of my
                    government, <pb facs="0331" n="985" xml:id="pg985"/> in which is inserted a
                    communication from the governor of the State of Sonora relative to the entrance
                    of several armed men from Arizona into Mexican territory, who apprehended a
                    fugitive named J. Holmes within the limits of the said State.</p>
                <p>In obedience to the instructions contained in said note, I beg leave to call your
                    attention to the matter in question, and to express the hope that the Government
                    of the United States will adopt suitable measures for its repression, (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">sic</hi>,) thus preventing the repetition of an abuse
                    committed, perhaps, without any intention of outraging the Mexican nation, but
                    which might at some time give rise to disagreeable consequences on the frontier,
                    despite of the good understanding which happily exists between the governments
                    of the two republics.</p>
                <p>I am happy to renew, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>IGNO. MARISCAL.</signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d163-a1.xml" xpointer="d163-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
